function rangeStats(e,range,kind){const s=stats(recordsFor(e,range)),totalDays=daysBetween(range[1],range[0])+1;return`<div class="stats-row compact-stats"><div><span class="stat-value">${s.count}</span><span class="stat-label">次</span></div><div><span class="stat-value">${s.days}</span><span class="stat-label">天</span></div><div><span class="stat-value">${Math.round(s.days/totalDays*100)}</span><span class="stat-label">%</span></div></div>`;}
function statsControl(label,date,kind){const d=parseDay(date),range=rangeFor('week',date);const text=kind==='week'?`${range[0].slice(5).replace('-','-')} ~ ${range[1].slice(5)}`:['month','period'].includes(kind)?`${d.getFullYear()}-${pad(d.getMonth()+1)}`:`${d.getFullYear()}`;return`<div class="panel-top"><span class="panel-title">${label}</span><div class="panel-date"><button data-action="stats-date" data-kind="${kind}">${text}</button>${ib('back','stats-prev','上一个','data-kind="'+kind+'"')}${ib('next','stats-next','下一个','data-kind="'+kind+'"')}</div></div>`;}
function monthCells(date,e){const d=parseDay(date),y=d.getFullYear(),m=d.getMonth(),n=monthDays(y,m),offset=(new Date(y,m,1).getDay()+6)%7;return`<div class="month-grid">${weekdays.map(v=>`<span class="weekday">${v}</span>`).join('')}${'<span></span>'.repeat(offset)}${Array.from({length:n},(_,i)=>{const key=`${y}-${pad(m+1)}-${pad(i+1)}`,r=recordsFor(e,[key,key]);return`<button class="day-cell ${r.length?'recorded':''} ${key===today()?'today':''}" data-action="record-day" data-date="${key}" aria-label="${fmt(key)}，${r.length}次记录"><span>${i+1}</span>${r.length?`<small>${e.checkmark?'✓':stats(r).total}</small>`:''}</button>`;}).join('')}</div>`;}
function yearHeat(e){const y=parseDay(yearDate).getFullYear();return`<div class="year-chart" role="group" aria-label="年度记录分布，纵向周一至周日"><div class="year-weekdays" aria-hidden="true">${['周一','周二','周三','周四','周五','周六','周日'].map(label=>`<span>${label}</span>`).join('')}</div><div class="year-wrap"><div class="year-grid">${Array.from({length:12},(_,m)=>{let squares='<i class="heat empty"></i>'.repeat((new Date(y,m,1).getDay()+6)%7);for(let d=1;d<=monthDays(y,m);d++){const key=`${y}-${pad(m+1)}-${pad(d)}`,r=recordsFor(e,[key,key]);squares+=`<button class="heat ${r.length?'on':''}" data-action="record-day" data-date="${key}" title="${fmt(key)} · ${r.length}次" aria-label="${fmt(key)}，${r.length}次记录"></button>`;}return`<div class="year-month"><span>${m+1}月</span><div class="month-heat">${squares}</div></div>`;}).join('')}</div></div></div><div class="heat-legend"><i></i>未记录<i class="on"></i>已记录</div>`;}
function detail(){const e=current();if(!e){page='home';return home();}const wr=rangeFor('week',weekDate),mr=rangeFor('month',monthDate),yr=rangeFor('year',yearDate),overview=stats(recordsFor(e,[overviewFrom||e.startDate,viewDate])),records=recordsFor(e,[overviewFrom||e.startDate,viewDate]).sort((a,b)=>a.date.localeCompare(b.date)),interval=overview.days>1?Math.round(daysBetween(records.at(-1).date.slice(0,10),records[0].date.slice(0,10))/(overview.days-1)*10)/10:0;return`${back()}<div style="--accent:${e.color}"><div class="detail-heading"><h1>${icon(e.icon)} ${esc(e.name)}</h1></div><div class="detail-subtitle">${e.startDate} ~ ${e.endDate||'至今'}（${Math.max(0,daysBetween(e.endDate||today(),e.startDate)+1)} 天）<span>${e.archived?'已归档':'所有'}</span></div><div class="detail-actions">${button('编辑','edit-event','action-tile','settings')}${button('历史记录','history','action-tile','history')}${button('补录','add-record','action-tile','plus',e.archived?'disabled':'')}</div><div class="stat-panel overview-panel"><div class="panel-top"><span class="panel-title">概览</span><div class="panel-date"><button type="button" class="overview-date-button" data-action="overview-start" aria-label="统计开始日期 ${overviewFrom||e.startDate}" aria-haspopup="dialog"><span>${overviewFrom||e.startDate}</span>${icon('down')}</button><span>~</span><button type="button" class="overview-date-button" data-action="overview-date" aria-label="统计结束日期 ${viewDate}" aria-haspopup="dialog"><span>${viewDate}</span>${icon('down')}</button></div></div><div class="stats-row"><div><div class="stat-value">${overview.count}</div><div class="stat-label">总次数</div></div><div><div class="stat-value">${overview.days}</div><div class="stat-label">总天数</div></div><div><div class="stat-value">${e.type==='count'?interval:formatNumber(overview.total)}</div><div class="stat-label">${e.type==='duration'?'累计时长（分钟）':e.type==='value'?'累计数值'+(e.unit?'（'+esc(e.unit)+'）':''):'平均间隔'}</div></div></div></div><div class="stat-panel">${statsControl('周统计',weekDate,'week')}<div class="week-bars">${Array.from({length:7},(_,i)=>{const date=addDays(wr[0],i),r=recordsFor(e,[date,date]);return`<button class="bar ${r.length?'filled':''}" data-action="record-day" data-date="${date}" aria-label="${fmt(date)}，${r.length}次记录">${r.length?(e.checkmark?'✓':stats(r).total):''}</button>`;}).join('')}</div>${rangeStats(e,wr,'一周')}</div><div class="stat-panel">${statsControl('月统计',monthDate,'month')}${monthCells(monthDate,e)}${rangeStats(e,mr,'本月')}</div><div class="stat-panel">${statsControl('年统计',yearDate,'year')}${yearHeat(e)}${rangeStats(e,yr,'本年')}</div></div>`;}
function history(){const e=current();if(!e)return home();const range=rangeFor(historyTab,historyDate),r=[...recordsFor(e,range)].sort((a,b)=>b.date.localeCompare(a.date)),dates=[...new Set(r.map(r=>r.date.slice(0,10)))],rangeText=historyTab==='week'?`${range[0].slice(5)} ~ ${range[1].slice(5)}`:historyTab==='month'?historyDate.slice(0,7):historyTab==='year'?historyDate.slice(0,4):'所有';return`<header class="native-header">${ib('back','detail-back','返回事件')}<h1>历史记录</h1><span></span></header><div style="--accent:${e.color}"><div class="tabs history-tabs">${[['week','周'],['month','月'],['year','年'],['all','所有']].map(([k,v])=>`<button class="tab ${historyTab===k?'active':''}" data-action="history-tab" data-tab="${k}">${v}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="history-range"><button data-action="history-date" ${historyTab==='all'?'disabled':''}>${rangeText} <small>（${r.length}）</small></button>${historyTab!=='all'?`<div>${ib('back','history-prev','上一个周期')}${ib('next','history-next','下一个周期')}</div>`:''}</div>${dates.map(date=>`<section class="history-group"><div class="history-date">${date.slice(5)}</div>${r.filter(r=>r.date.startsWith(date)).map(recordRow).join('')}</section>`).join('')}${button('','add-record','floating-add','plus','aria-label="添加记录"')}</div>`;}
function recordRow(r){const e=eventById(r.eventId);return`<div class="record-row" style="--accent:${e?.color||'#a38af0'}"><time class="record-time">${r.date.slice(11,16)}</time><i class="record-dot"></i><div class="record-info">${esc(page==='calendar'?e?.name:(r.note||'无备注'))}${r.note&&page==='calendar'?`<small>${esc(r.note)}</small>`:''}</div>${e?.type!=='count'?`<div class="record-value">${formatNumber(r.value)}<small>${esc(e?unit(e):'')}</small></div>`:''}${ib('more','record-menu','编辑或删除记录','data-id="'+r.id+'"')}</div>`;}
function countdowns(){return`${heading('倒计时','','',button('','new-countdown','icon-btn','plus','aria-label="新增倒计时"'))}<div class="countdown-grid">${sortCountdowns(data.countdowns).map(c=>{const n=countdownDays(c);return`<button type="button" class="countdown-card ${c.pinned?'is-pinned':''} ${n<0?'is-past':''}" data-countdown-id="${c.id}" aria-label="编辑${esc(c.title)}${c.pinned?'，已置顶':''}" aria-description="单击编辑，长按或双击置顶"><span class="countdown-art">${countdownArtwork(c)}</span><span class="countdown-copy"><span class="countdown-name">${esc(c.title)}${c.pinned?'<span class="countdown-pin" aria-label="已置顶">'+icon('pin')+'</span>':''}</span><span class="countdown-date">${c.date.replaceAll('-','/')}</span></span><span class="countdown-number"><strong>${Math.abs(n)}</strong><small>${n<0?'天了':n===0?'就是今天':'天后'}</small></span></button>`;}).join('')}</div>${!data.countdowns.length?empty('还没有倒计时','记下一个期待的日子。','','','calendar'):''}${button('','new-countdown','floating-add','plus','aria-label="添加倒计时"')}`;}
function countdownArtwork(c){return c.image?`<img src="${esc(c.image)}" alt="">`:icon(c.icon||'🎉');}
async function toggleCountdownPin(id){const c=data.countdowns.find(c=>c.id===id);if(!c)return;c.pinned=!c.pinned;c.pinnedAt=c.pinned?Date.now():0;if(await persist()){render();notify(c.pinned?'已置顶':'已取消置顶');}}

function calendar(){const d=parseDay(calendarDate),y=d.getFullYear(),m=d.getMonth(),first=`${y}-${pad(m+1)}-01`,offset=(new Date(y,m,1).getDay()+6)%7,start=addDays(first,-offset),agenda=data.records.filter(r=>r.date.startsWith(calendarSelected)).sort((a,b)=>b.date.localeCompare(a.date)),dates=data.countdowns.filter(c=>countdownDate(c,calendarSelected)===calendarSelected);return`${heading('日历','','')}<div class="calendar-panel"><div class="panel-top"><button class="panel-title" data-action="calendar-month">${monthHeading(calendarDate)} ${icon('down')}</button><div class="panel-date">${button('今日','calendar-today','today-link')}${ib('back','calendar-prev','上个月')}${ib('next','calendar-next','下个月')}</div></div><div class="full-calendar">${weekdays.map(v=>`<div class="weekday">周${v}</div>`).join('')}${Array.from({length:42},(_,i)=>{const key=addDays(start,i),inMonth=key.slice(0,7)===first.slice(0,7),eventIds=[...new Set(data.records.filter(r=>r.date.startsWith(key)).map(r=>r.eventId))],cd=data.countdowns.filter(c=>countdownDate(c,key)===key);return`<button class="calendar-day ${!inMonth?'other-month':''} ${key===calendarSelected?'selected':''} ${key===today()?'is-today':''}" data-action="calendar-day" data-date="${key}" aria-label="${fmt(key)}"><span>${parseDay(key).getDate()}</span>${cd.map(c=>`<span class="cal-chip" style="--chip-color:${c.color}">${esc(c.title)}${/生日/.test(c.title)?' ~':''}</span>`).join('')}${eventIds.map(id=>{const e=eventById(id);return e?`<span class="cal-chip" style="--chip-color:color-mix(in srgb,${e.color} 15%,white)">${icon(e.icon)}${esc(e.name)}</span>`:'';}).join('')}</button>`;}).join('')}</div></div>${agenda.length||dates.length?`<section class="calendar-agenda"><div class="agenda-title">${fmt(calendarSelected,true)}</div>${dates.map(c=>`<div class="record-row"><div class="record-info">${esc(c.title)}${/生日/.test(c.title)?' ~':''}</div><span class="cal-chip">就是今天</span></div>`).join('')}${agenda.map(recordRow).join('')}</section>`:''}`;}
function searchResults(){
 const query=searchText.trim().toLocaleLowerCase();
 if(searchScope==='events'){const matches=data.events.filter(e=>(e.name+' '+(e.note||'')).toLocaleLowerCase().includes(query));return matches.map(e=>eventCard(e,'search')).join('')||empty('未找到相关事件','换个关键词试试');}
 const matches=sortCountdowns(data.countdowns).filter(c=>(c.title+' '+(c.note||'')+' '+c.date+' '+c.date.replaceAll('-','/')).toLocaleLowerCase().includes(query));
 return matches.map(c=>{const n=countdownDays(c);return`<button type="button" class="countdown-card search-countdown-result ${n<0?'is-past':''}" data-action="search-countdown" data-id="${c.id}" aria-label="编辑${esc(c.title)}"><span class="countdown-art">${countdownArtwork(c)}</span><span class="countdown-copy"><span class="countdown-name">${esc(c.title)}</span><span class="countdown-date">${c.date.replaceAll('-','/')}</span></span><span class="countdown-number"><strong>${Math.abs(n)}</strong><small>${n<0?'天了':n===0?'就是今天':'天后'}</small></span></button>`;}).join('')||empty('未找到相关倒计时','换个关键词试试');
}
function search(){return`<header class="native-header search-header">${ib('close','home','关闭搜索')}<div class="search-kind-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="搜索范围">${[['events','事件'],['countdowns','倒计时']].map(([key,label])=>`<button class="search-kind ${searchScope===key?'active':''}" data-action="search-scope" data-scope="${key}" role="tab" aria-selected="${searchScope===key}" tabindex="${searchScope===key?'0':'-1'}">${label}</button>`).join('')}</div><span></span></header><label class="search-input">${icon('search')}<input id="search-field" placeholder="搜索" aria-label="搜索${searchScope==='events'?'事件':'倒计时'}" value="${esc(searchText)}" autocomplete="off">${ib('close','clear-search','清空搜索')}</label><div id="search-results" class="event-list ${searchScope==='countdowns'?'search-countdown-list':''}">${searchResults()}</div>`;}
function setSearchScope(scope){if(!['events','countdowns'].includes(scope)||searchScope===scope)return;const focus=$('#search-field')===document.activeElement;searchScope=scope;render();if(focus)$('#search-field').focus();}

function memories(){const entries=[...data.memories].sort((a,b)=>b.date.localeCompare(a.date));const dates=[...new Set(entries.map(m=>m.date.slice(0,10)))];return`${heading('回忆','KEEP A LITTLE MOMENT','',ib('camera','new-memory','写一条记录'))}<div class="timeline">${!entries.length?empty('留住当下的美好瞬间','一张照片，一点心情。 从今天开始，慢慢收集。','写一条记录','new-memory','camera'):''}${dates.map(date=>`<section class="memory-day"><div class="memory-day-label"><strong>${date===today()?'今天':parseDay(date).getDate()}</strong>${date!==today()?`<small>${parseDay(date).getMonth()+1}月<br>${parseDay(date).getFullYear()!==new Date().getFullYear()?parseDay(date).getFullYear():''}</small>`:''}</div><div>${entries.filter(m=>m.date.startsWith(date)).map(m=>`<article class="memory-entry">${m.text?`<p>${esc(m.text)}</p>`:''}${m.photos.length?`<div class="memory-photos ${m.photos.length===1?'single':''}">${m.photos.map((p,i)=>`<button data-action="view-photo" data-id="${m.id}" data-index="${i}" aria-label="查看照片 ${i+1}"><img src="${esc(p)}" alt="${esc(m.text.slice(0,50)||'记录的瞬间')}" loading="lazy"></button>`).join('')}</div>`:''}<div class="memory-footer"><time>${m.date.slice(11,16)}</time>${ib('more','memory-menu','编辑或删除回忆','data-id="'+m.id+'"')}</div></article>`).join('')}</div></section>`).join('')}</div>`;}
function render(){if(page!=='account')accountUI.unmount();searchBinding?.destroy();searchBinding=null;countdownBindings?.destroy();countdownBindings=null;const routes={home,detail,history,countdowns,calendar,search,memories,account:accountPage,period:periodView,'period-history':periodHistoryView,camera:cameraView};$('#app').innerHTML=`<div class="shell page-${page}">${page==='home'?topbar():''}${!storageOk?'<div class="storage-error">本机存储未能保存。请导出备份，勿关闭页面。</div>':''}<main>${(routes[page]||home)()}</main></div>${['home','countdowns'].includes(page)?nav():''}`;document.title=`MY DAY · ${{home:'日常',detail:current()?.name||'事件',history:'历史记录',countdowns:'倒计时',calendar:'日历',search:'搜索',memories:'回忆',account:'本地数据',period:'经期','period-history':'经期统计',camera:'记录此刻'}[page]||'日常'}`;fitCounters();if(page==='account')accountUI.mount($('#account-content'));if(page==='search')searchBinding=bindSearchGestures($('#app'),{getScope:()=>searchScope,onChange:(scope,swiped)=>{if(swiped)searchSuppressUntil=Date.now()+600;setSearchScope(scope);},isBlocked:()=>sheet.open||picker.open||confirmation.open});if(page==='period')bindPeriodCalendar();if(page==='countdowns')countdownBindings=bindCountdownCards($('#app'),{onOpen:id=>{if(page==='countdowns'&&!sheet.open&&!picker.open&&!confirmation.open)countdownEditor(id);},onPin:toggleCountdownPin});}
function navigate(next){if(next!=='account'&&syncStatus==='sign-in'&&document.querySelector('meta[name=my-day-account-entry]')?.content==='true'){notify('请先登录账号');return;}if(page==='account'&&next!=='account'&&accountUI.hasRecoveryToSave()){notify('请先保存恢复码并点击我已保存');return;}if(page==='account'&&next!=='account'&&(accountUI.isBusy()||accountTransitionLocked)){notify(accountUI.isBusy()?'正在处理账号，请稍候或点取消':'账号记录尚未读取完成，请联网后重试');return;}homeGestures.reset();window.history.replaceState(null,'',location.pathname+location.search+(next==='countdowns'?'#countdowns':next==='account'?'#local':''));if(next==='home'){tab='all';group='全部';}if(page==='camera'&&next!=='camera')camera.stop();page=next;render();window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'instant'});}
function openDetail(id){activeId=id;overviewFrom=eventById(id)?.startDate||today();viewDate=weekDate=monthDate=yearDate=today();navigate('detail');}

function showSheet(title,body,onSave=null,options={}){if(sheet.open)sheet.close();sheet.className=options.mode||'';sheet.style.top='';sheet.style.removeProperty('--accent');sheet.style.removeProperty('--on-accent');sheetState={onSave,dirty:options.dirty||(()=>false),onClose:options.onClose};sheet.setAttribute('aria-label',title.replace(/<[^>]*>/g,''));$('#sheet-content').innerHTML=`<div class="sheet-head">${ib('close','close-sheet','取消')}<h2>${title}</h2>${onSave?ib('check','save-sheet','保存'):'<span style="width:34px"></span>'}</div>${body}`;if(options.mode==='countdown-editor'){$('[data-action="close-sheet"]',sheet).textContent='取消';$('[data-action="save-sheet"]',sheet).textContent='保存';}sheet.showModal();sheet.scrollTop=0;}
async function closeSheet(force=false){if(!sheet.open)return;if(!force&&sheetState?.dirty()&&!await ask('放弃修改？','未保存的内容将不会保留。','放弃修改'))return;const done=sheetState?.onClose;sheet.close();sheetState=null;done?.();}
function ask(title,copy,confirm='确定',danger=false){return new Promise(resolve=>{$('#confirm-content').innerHTML=`<div class="confirm-box"><h2>${esc(title)}</h2><p>${esc(copy)}</p><div class="confirm-actions"><button class="full-btn cancel-btn" id="confirm-no">取消</button><button class="full-btn ${danger?'danger':'primary'}" id="confirm-yes">${esc(confirm)}</button></div></div>`;confirmation.showModal();const finish=value=>{confirmation.close();resolve(value);};$('#confirm-no').onclick=()=>finish(false);$('#confirm-yes').onclick=()=>finish(true);confirmation.oncancel=event=>{event.preventDefault();finish(false);};});}
function pickerClose(){eventChoiceAnchor?.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');if(eventChoiceReposition)window.removeEventListener('resize',eventChoiceReposition);eventChoiceAnchor=null;eventChoiceReposition=null;picker.close();picker.className='';picker.removeAttribute('style');iconSelection=null;}
function showInfo(text){$('#picker-content').innerHTML=`<h2 class="picker-title">说明</h2><p class="sheet-subtitle" style="font-size:12px;margin-bottom:25px">${esc(text)}</p>${button('知道了','close-picker','full-btn primary')}`;picker.showModal();}
function wheelPicker(value,onChoose,{time=false,timeOnly=false,title='选择日期',allowEmpty=false,minYear=1900,maxYear=2100}={}){const datePart=value?.slice(0,10)||today(),d=parseDay(datePart);let selected={year:d.getFullYear(),month:d.getMonth()+1,day:d.getDate(),hour:parseInt((timeOnly?value:value?.slice(11))?.slice(0,2)||'12'),minute:parseInt((timeOnly?value:value?.slice(11))?.slice(3,5)||'00')};const cols=timeOnly?['hour','minute']:time?['year','month','day','hour','minute']:['year','month','day'];const labels={year:'年',month:'月',day:'日',hour:'时',minute:'分'};const values=k=>k==='year'?Array.from({length:maxYear-minYear+1},(_,i)=>minYear+i):k==='month'?Array.from({length:12},(_,i)=>i+1):k==='day'?Array.from({length:monthDays(selected.year,selected.month-1)},(_,i)=>i+1):Array.from({length:k==='hour'?24:60},(_,i)=>i);
 const draw=()=>{$('#picker-content').innerHTML=`<h2 class="picker-title">${title}</h2><div class="wheel-head">${cols.map(k=>`<span>${labels[k]}</span>`).join('')}</div><div class="wheels"><div class="wheel-selection"></div>${cols.map(k=>`<div class="wheel" data-wheel="${k}" tabindex="0" role="listbox" aria-label="选择${labels[k]}">${values(k).map(n=>`<button class="wheel-option" data-n="${n}" tabindex="-1" role="option" aria-selected="${n===selected[k]}">${k==='year'?n:pad(n)}</button>`).join('')}</div>`).join('')}</div><div class="picker-actions">${button('取消','close-picker','full-btn cancel-btn')}<button class="full-btn primary" id="wheel-confirm">完成</button></div>${allowEmpty?'<button id="wheel-empty" class="full-btn" style="margin-top:10px;color:#a1aa95">不设置结束日期</button>':''}`;
  for(const col of $$('.wheel',picker)){const k=col.dataset.wheel,vs=values(k);col.scrollTop=vs.indexOf(selected[k])*40;let timer;const read=()=>{if(!col.isConnected||!picker.open)return;const freshValues=values(k);const index=Math.max(0,Math.min(freshValues.length-1,Math.round(col.scrollTop/40)));selected[k]=freshValues[index];$$('[role="option"]',col).forEach((el,i)=>el.setAttribute('aria-selected',i===index));if(k==='month'||k==='year'){const days=values('day');selected.day=Math.min(selected.day,days.length);const dayCol=$('[data-wheel="day"]',picker);if(dayCol&&dayCol.children.length!==days.length){dayCol.innerHTML=days.map(n=>`<button class="wheel-option" data-n="${n}" tabindex="-1">${pad(n)}</button>`).join('');dayCol.scrollTop=(selected.day-1)*40;}}};col.onscroll=()=>{clearTimeout(timer);timer=setTimeout(read,70);};col.onclick=ev=>{const b=ev.target.closest('[data-n]');if(b){col.scrollTop=values(k).indexOf(+b.dataset.n)*40;read();}};col.onkeydown=ev=>{if(['ArrowUp','ArrowDown'].includes(ev.key)){ev.preventDefault();col.scrollTop+=ev.key==='ArrowUp'?-40:40;read();}};}
  $('#wheel-confirm').onclick=()=>{for(const col of $$('.wheel',picker)){const k=col.dataset.wheel,vs=values(k);selected[k]=vs[Math.max(0,Math.min(vs.length-1,Math.round(col.scrollTop/40)))];}selected.day=Math.min(selected.day,monthDays(selected.year,selected.month-1));const date=`${selected.year}-${pad(selected.month)}-${pad(selected.day)}`,t=`${pad(selected.hour)}:${pad(selected.minute)}`;pickerClose();onChoose(timeOnly?t:time?`${date}T${t}`:date);};if(allowEmpty)$('#wheel-empty').onclick=()=>{pickerClose();onChoose('');};};draw();picker.showModal();for(const col of $$('.wheel',picker))col.scrollTop=values(col.dataset.wheel).indexOf(selected[col.dataset.wheel])*40;}

